# ---- Editors / OS ----
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- Logs ----
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# ---- Local agent tooling ----
# Machine-local, except the skills, which are project tooling the same way
# .github/workflows is -- they describe how this codebase wants to be worked on, so
# they belong to everyone who clones it. Git will not descend into an excluded
# directory, so this has to exclude the contents rather than the directory itself; a
# bare `.claude/` would make the `!` below do nothing.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# ---- Design review ----
# Regenerated on demand from a local fixture set. Forty full-page PNGs at 3x go stale
# the moment a rule moves, and this repo's whole character is leanness.
/screenshots/

# ---- Local data ----
# A working folder for data pulled down to the laptop. Never part of the build.
/database_source/
